# Two Parts, each asking for more than it needs: a full sort to read the top
# three, and a sort in front of a sum. Rewrites used to stop at the Part
# boundary; now a Part reads its body from the optimizer the way the top level
# does, so both become what a programmer who noticed would write.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Part "top":
    Domain Expansion: Quicksort, Descending
    Maximum Technique: Select Top 3, Sum
    Reveal: stdout
Part "sum":
    Domain Expansion: Quicksort
    Cursed Technique: Filter
        Using: (x) -> x % 2 = 1
    Cursed Technique: Map Each
        Using: (x) -> x * 3 + 1
    Maximum Technique: Sum
    Reveal: stdout
